abstract: >-
  Vietnamese AI Framework (v31.1.0) introduces ViLegal-TemporalRAG and the open
  ViLegal-TempBench benchmark for temporal, clause-level graph-grounded Vietnamese
  legal retrieval and deterministic three-tier citation verification (Citation
  Grounding, Temporal Consistency, and Numeric/Deadline Consistency), engineered
  to run reproducibly on CPU-only hardware with optional real LLM integration.
